{"speciesId":758,"names":{"fr":"Malamandre","es":"Salazzle","en":"Salazzle","ja":"エンニュート"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Curieusement, cette espèce ne compte que des femelles. Ces dernières aiment s’entourer de nombreux admirateurs Tritox mâles."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Por algún motivo desconocido, solo hay hembras. Suele formarse su propio harén compuesto por Salandit machos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"For some reason, only females have been found. It creates a reverse harem of male Salandit that it lives with."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"なぜか ♀しか 見つかっていない。 ヤトウモリの♂を 引き連れて 逆ハーレムを 作って 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son gaz toxique est riche en phéromones. Il est possible d’isoler ces dernières pour concocter un puissant parfum aphrodisiaque."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su gas venenoso contiene numerosas feromonas. Al diluirlo es posible elaborar un perfume que resulta verdaderamente embriagador."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Filled with pheromones, its poisonous gas can be diluted to use in the production of luscious perfumes."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"毒ガスには 多くの フェロモンが 含まれている。 薄めることで 官能的な 香水が できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon habite au fin fond des cavernes. Il se fait servir par des Tritox envoûtés par ses phéromones."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Vive en las profundidades de las cuevas. Gracias a sus feromonas, atrae Salandit y los hace presas de su voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Salazzle lives deep in caves and forces the Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"洞窟の 奥深くに 棲み フェロモンで メロメロに した ヤトウモリたちを 侍らせている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Malamandre punit sans merci les Tritox qui rentrent bredouilles de la chasse, généralement d’une gifle de sa paume enflammée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Castiga a los Salandit que no le traen caza abofeteándolos con sus ardientes zarpas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It punishes Salandit that couldn’t bring it food with a fierce slap of its flame-spewing palm."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"エサが 獲れなかった ヤトウモリを 炎が 噴き出す 手のひらで 激しく ビンタし お仕置きする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il n’existe que des spécimens femelles. Elles envoûtent les Tritox mâles grâce à leurs nuages de phéromones."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Solo hay hembras. Gracias a sus feromonas, atrae a los Salandit macho y los somete a su voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Only female Salazzle exist. They emit a gas laden with pheromones to captivate male Salandit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"エンニュートは メスしか いない。 フェロモンガスを 発生させて オスの ヤトウモリを 魅了する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les conflits entre Malamandre seraient réglés par un simple calcul : le spécimen dont la suite comporte le plus de Tritox l’emporte."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Libran disputas con sus congéneres cuyo resultado, al parecer, se inclina por quien tenga un séquito de Salandit machos más numeroso."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The winner of competitions between Salazzle is decided by which one has the most male Salandit with it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"エンニュート同士の 争いは 引き連れている オスの ヤトウモリの 数で 勝敗が 決まるらしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":758,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,